# Logs / runtime artifacts
#
# This repo DOES publish *this bot's* trade history (fresh, Spotify-only):
# - `trades.log` (legacy CSV-ish)
# - `trades.jsonl` (preferred)
#
# But we still ignore other runtime artifacts.
*.log
!trades.log
!trades.jsonl
positions_cache.json
ai_insights.jsonl

